s now a prisoner at the hideout. Having slain his own father, Guel remains sunk in deep despair.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lvEEZex47TCz8yobHIBUFqEy9L5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lvEEZex47TCz8yobHIBUFqEy9L5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/196400/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"4354658","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The school is in chaos as a result of the Open Campus incident. The Benerit Group's coverup of the incident and its aggressive security operations on Earth have been reported to the public, and it decides to hold an election to turn the situation around.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rTgNiTH4jSymaLQKz16dWlSfnd9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rTgNiTH4jSymaLQKz16dWlSfnd9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/196400/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"4354662","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Having learned of the connection between Prospera and Delling, Miorine decides to take over the Quiet Zero project in exchange for Suletta's liberation. Miorine's 17th birthday is imminent. Now the curtain rises on the final duel that will determine her bridegroom.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bfhdrf3OfNf8s9olmBweYewckr6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bfhdrf3OfNf8s9olmBweYewckr6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/196400/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"4354